1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,165
This cockroach can fire a needle.

2
00:00:02,165 --> 00:00:03,400
And a person holding a remote

3
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:04,945
decides when it shoots.

4
00:00:04,945 --> 00:00:06,620
Scientists strapped a tiny launcher

5
00:00:06,620 --> 00:00:08,050
onto a living cockroach,

6
00:00:08,050 --> 00:00:09,380
then used electrical pulses

7
00:00:09,380 --> 00:00:10,450
to steer it.

8
00:00:10,450 --> 00:00:11,330
A second cockroach

9
00:00:11,330 --> 00:00:12,385
carries a camera,

10
00:00:12,385 --> 00:00:13,520
letting the operator watch

11
00:00:13,520 --> 00:00:15,495
as the first moves into position.

12
00:00:15,495 --> 00:00:16,475
Once it lines up,

13
00:00:16,475 --> 00:00:18,100
they fire the injector.

14
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:19,000
They’ve demonstrated this

15
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:20,600
on laboratory targets.

16
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:21,800
But the plan is to send them

17
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:23,335
beneath collapsed buildings,

18
00:00:23,335 --> 00:00:25,230
carrying emergency medicine.

19
00:00:25,230 --> 00:00:26,390
So if you’re trapped

20
00:00:26,390 --> 00:00:27,220
and something starts

21
00:00:27,220 --> 00:00:28,635
crawling toward you…

22
00:00:28,635 --> 00:00:29,750
you might actually want it

23
00:00:29,750 --> 00:00:30,940
to get closer.

